Daniel,

If, after a vanilla ‘git clone …’ to get a clean cmdstan directory, I use:

make stan-revert

also works for both stan and example-models, so the —init flag is needed.

The other confusing thing is that the main makefile still mentions

EIGEN ?= $(STANAPI_HOME)lib/eigen_3.2.0

The makefile in the stan subdir seems to be correct ( EIGEN ?= lib/eigen_3.2.2 ).

